+# Billing disputes
+
+`classifyBillingQuestion` in `/src/billing.ts` classifies billing questions for human review. A message containing the exact lowercase text `refund` receives `refund-review`; other billing messages receive `invoice-question`.
+
+These classifications route the question; they do not decide refund eligibility, approve or deny a refund, or establish whether an invoice is correct.

